# Drop .glb files here — they'll be served at /models/<filename>.glb
# 
# Expected assets:
#   tractor.glb       — Farm hero tractor
#   barn.glb          — Farm barn
#   farmer.glb        — Farmer avatar (replaces procedural)
#   crane.glb         — Build hero crane
#   building.glb      — Build hero WIP building
#   builder.glb       — Builder avatar (replaces procedural)
#   tree.glb          — Farm trees (optional)
